OL,3,GNEWSAScientists and fishermen celebrate
OL,4,Areturn of tuna
OL,5,
OL,6,FScientists and fishermen are working
OL,7,Ftogether to get a better understanding
OL,8,Fof the increasing number of Atlantic
OL,9,Fbluefin tuna in the UK's waters.
OL,11,FEcology professor at the University of
OL,12,FExeter Dr Lucy Hawkes said the bluefin
OL,13,Fpopulation had collapsed through
OL,14,Foverfishing by the mid-1960s but was
OL,15,Fnow thriving.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
