OL,3,GNEWSAScientists and fishermen celebrate
OL,4,Areturn of tuna
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Environment, Food
OL,7,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) called the
OL,8,Freturn "one of the most exciting
OL,9,Fdevelopments in our fisheries for
OL,10,Fdecades" and the Marine Management
OL,11,FOrganisation (MMO) has approved the
OL,12,Fhighest ever quota and number of
OL,13,Fpermits to fishermen to catch them.
OL,15,FNewlyn fisherman Andrew Pascoe said: "I
OL,16,Fdon't see any reason why the permits
OL,17,Fcan't double again in the next three or
OL,18,Ffour years if the science is good and
OL,19,Fthe management says we can catch more."
